<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">Kaa La</book>
  <para style="h">Kaa La</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kaa La</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kaa La</para>
  <para style="mt">Kaa La</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun khat lai-a mi a dimna khuopi daidam talawm sam e izaw! Minamte lahah a liensa kimlai, bang dinga meigong bang ta adiei! Gamkhente lahah kumpinu hi sa kimlai, tu-in mi sila a suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zan khuovahin kap a, a hlitui a bieng gelah a luong hi; a guolngai zosie lahah ama henem ding khat beh om lo hi; ama tungah a guolte zosie muonhuoi loin a gamta vua, amate pen ama’ gal le sa a suoh sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah mite, bawlsietna le na hamsa a sem sawltahpi dingin salin kikai mang zo hi; tu-in ama’ minamte lahah ama teng a, khawl nading mun a mu sih hi; a lungdon hun laitahin a delte in ama a nuaphah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zion zotna lampite a mau vangut uhi, azieh pen pawi sim dingin koima a pei ta sih hi; A kotpi zosie kitawn nawn loin a siempute uh tau vangut uhi; a ngahnute a lunggim vua, ama’ tanh khu mudana ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A galte pen a pute suohin, a galte a dau uh a pei hi. Azieh pen a suhkhiel a tam seng ziehin Topa in ama gimna thuohsah hi; galte mai-ah a tate galmatin kikaimang sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion’ tanu thupina zosie maimang sieng zo ta hi. A makaite, neh ding lohing a mu zo lo sazuh tawh kibang hi; a delte mai-ah amate thazawmin a taimang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem in a genthei ni le a vaiva ni-in tanglai-in ama-a’ ahi sil manpha zosie a phawhkia hi. Galte khut sungah a mite a pua lai-in, koima in ama panpi lo a, a galte in ama’ kiehsuhna enin a nuisan lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem, nahpitahin maw a, tuaci’n mite’ simmaw a thuoh hi. Ama zahtah zosie in a guohtanga a op a mu ziehun ama a thuse ta sih uhi; ama le ama a tau vangut a, ama in a mai a lehei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nih ah ama’ sientho lona a baang hi; ama in a mailam ding ngaisun lo hi; a kiehsuhna nasie mama a, a henem ding khat zong nei lo hi. “ Topa aw, ka gentheina ei en in, azieh pen galte in ei zo gawp hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau’ van manphate tungah galte in a khut a zah uhi; kikhopna sunga lut dinga na kham lawkite nangawn a biehinn sungah a lut uh ama in a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Neh ding a sui kawmun ama’ mi zosie tau vangut uhi; amate a thahatkia nadingun a goute uh an tawh a khel uhi. Topa aw, bangma ka mat lona ei en inlen ei mu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ei nawhkha zosie aw, no dingin bangma ahi sih amah? Ei en unlen ei mu un. Topa a thangpai mama ni-in ka tunga a tunsah gimna tawh a kibang gimna a om amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tunglam panin meikuong ang sawl a, ka gu ka tang teng ei zen hi; ka tot ding lenthang ei sie a, ama in ei kinualesah hi; sun nitumin khuo phawh lo, thazawngkhalin ei nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahkol ah ka khielnate kikanbawm a, tuate ama’ khut tawh ei khitha hi; ka ngawngah tuate ei khaipieh uhi; katha kazung teng a hup sieng hi; ka nan zawh lo galte’ khut sungah Topa in keima ei pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in keima kunga om ka galhang zosie ei nuolpieh ta hi; ama in kei ei sim nading, ka tangvalte a suhguoi nading hun khat phuongzah hi. Topa in lengga cil bangin Judah’ tanu ngahnu siengtho a tuoncil ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei ei henem ding le ei hanthawn ding mi tawh ka kigamla hi; tam teng ziehin ka kapkap a, ka hlitui in ei hlummang hi; galte in a zawgawp ziehun ka tate a cimaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zion in a khutte a zah vangin a henem ding koima om lo hi; a innvengte a gal a suo thei nadingin Topa in Jacob sim dingin thu a pie zo hi; amate lahah Jerusalem a sieng lo na a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thugen langpangin ka ledo vangin Topa pen a man ahi bo hi; ahi vangin no mi zosie in ngai unlen ka thuohna en un; ka tangvalte le ka ngahnute salin kikaimang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka guolngaite ka hlan a, hinanle amate in kei ei sol uhi; ka siempute ule ka upate in a thahatkia nadingun an a sui kawmun khuopi sungah a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa aw, ka genthei dan ei en ven; kang nah langpan ziehin ka gil sung a kihotnawi a, ka sungah ka lungtang a kipingpei hi. Gawldungah namtem in tuol luong lumsah hi; inn sungah zong sina ma a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ei henem ding koima om loin amate in ka tauna a za uhi. Ka galte in ka gimna a za uhi; tam banga nei bawl a thangpha uhi. Na gensa ni hing tungsah inlen, amate keima tawh kibangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na mai-ah a gitlona zosie uh hing tung taheh; ka bawlkhielnate ziehin kei tungah na bawl bangin amate tungah zong bawl in; azieh pen ka khuisahna a tam seng ziehin, ka lungsim a gim hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bangci dan a Topa a lungthah zieha Zion’ tanu khu hici kisimmaw adiei! Ama in vantung panin Israel’ thupina leitungah paisuh zo hi; a lungthah ni-in ama in a keng ngahna phawh kha nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in hepina nei loin, Jacob’ tenna mun zosie susie zo hi; a lungthah ziehin ama in Judah tanu’ mun muonhuoi phelmang hi; ama in kumpi gam le a vaihawmte tuol sena-in nei-in muolphosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lungthah seng ziehin Israel’ thahatna zosie suguoi a, ama in galte mai-ah a khut zietlam dawh hi; ama in Jacob sungah meikuong bangin hal a, a kimvel zosie katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in gal bangin a thalpi kuoi a, alang pa bangin a zietlam khut tawh pang hi; ama in Zion tanu’ puonbuh sunga i kisahtheipi zosie that sieng hi; ama in meikuong bangin a lungsona a buosuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa pen gal bangin om a, Israel a susie hi; ama in a kumpi’ innte susie-in a kulpite zong a susie a, Judah tanute lai-ah kaa le mau a khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in um bangin a buh guoicimsah a, a biehbuh a susie hi; ama in Zion ah pawi le sabbath nite tawpsah a, a lungthah seng ziehin kumpi le siempute a ginase sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in a maitam thuse loin a mun siengtho a nuasie hi; ama in a galte’ khut sungah kumpi inn kulbangte a pie zo hi; pawi ni-in a kiko bangun Topa’ inn sungah amate a kiko valuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion tanu’ kulpi cipzan ding pen Topa in a sesa ahi hi; ama in ciemtena gamgi hawt a, a suhmang nadingin zong a khut a nuakai sih hi; ama in a kap a mau dingin leicien le kulpite siem a, amate khuisa-in a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lei-ah a tunkotte tum sieng hi; ama in tunkotgol sattanin susie hi; a kumpipa le a miliente uh salin a om vua, lamlahna om nawn loin, a kamsangte in zong Topa kung panin mangmuna a nga nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion tanu’ putehte ham loin tuol ah a to uhi; a lu zang vuah leivui a kibuoh vua, la-ip puon sil uhi; Jerusalem ngahnute zong a tuolkun sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kaa na lamin ka mit khamgawp a, ka gilsung a kikhuleh hi; ka mite a kisuhgam ziehin ka sinkha lei-ah a kibuohla ta hi, bangzieh ahei cile khuolai gawldung tengah naupangte le nausente husamin a balia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nute kungah, “An le tui hei-a om ahei?” ci-in a kapkap uhi. a liem a baite bangin khuopi gawldung lahah basamin a om vua, a nute uh’ kang sungah a hinna uh sunghla-in a si uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem tanu aw, nang adingin bang ka gen thei ding a, koi pen tawh kang tekah ding ahei? Zion tanu ngahnu siengtho aw, kang henem thei nadingin koi pen tawh hing te ding ka hei? Na sietna tuipi za-in a gol ziehin koi in hing damsah zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang adingin na kamsangte in a man lo, zuou mangmunate mu zo uhi; na hamphatna na ngakia thei nadingin amate in na khielna hing pholah loin, a man lo le ang puikhiel thei thuphuonte nangma adingin mu zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lampi dunga a peisunte in a khut uh a behsan hi; Jerusalem tanu ehneh ho-in a lu a peisan lel uhi; “Hoina bukim nei khuopi, leitung vannuoi’ kipahna khuopi kici tami amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na galte in nang langkhatah a kam uh kahin ang hawhsan uhi; amate in hing ehneh ho-in a ha a gawi vua, “Tam khuopi i susie ta ukhu! Kadei, i nganga uh tam ni a khula, a tawpna-ah i mu ta ukhu!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in a lungtup bawl zo a, a galgihna sem zo ta hi; sawtveipi lai-a a gelsa bangin ama in khuotuo loin a susie hi; ama in na tungah na galpa a kipahsah a, na galpa’ thahatna a tawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion tanu’ kulpi aw, Topa tungah nahpi-in kiko in! Sun le zanin na hlituite luitui luongsuh bang taheh! Nang le nang tawlnga sinlen, na mit zong sing da in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuocingte a kipat ciengin tho inlen kizanko ven! Topa mai-ah na lungsim tui bangin sungsuh in. Gawldung mong cintengah kielsi-in a basam na tate a hin thei nadingun ama lamah na khutte lamto in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa aw, en inlen ngaisun in! Koi tungah tam bangin na bawl ngel ahei? Nupite in a hinsa uh a tate’ sa a ne talawm ding uh amah? Topa’ mun siengtho ah siempute le kamsangte a kithat ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khangdawngte le khanghamte gawldung leilahah si-in a lum den uhi; ka ngahnute ule ka tangvalte uh, namsau tawh a puamat sieng uhi; na lungthah ni-in amate na that a, hepina om loin na that sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pawi ni-in mi a kihlat bangin nang in ka kimvela om ka galte na hlan hi; Topa’ lungthah ni-in koima suohta loin, a hing zong om lo hi; ka galpa in kakawi kapom lai le kava kata laite ei thapieh sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ lungthahna ciengpum nei-ah gentheina a thei pa ka hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama in ei delmangin khuovah a op lona khuomiel lahah ei peipi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />sun tawntungin kei tung behah a khut a hlang den mielmuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ka tel ka vo a vuoigawpsah a, ka gu ka tang a tawngsansah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ama in hin genthei le lunggimna tawh ei imtawmin ei tuomcip hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />sawtpi lai-a a sisa mite bangin khuomiel lahah ei tosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka suotah thei lo nadingin kul tawh ei imtawm hi; ama in a gih siakhau tawh ei khi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />panpina ngenin ka kiko vangin ka thumna ei khahtanpieh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama in a kikhengsa suongtumte tawh ka lampi ei khahtan a, ka lampite a kawisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama pen kei ei buhdap vompi le a kiphuol humpi tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ama in lam ei pielpi a, ei ehtelin ei nuasie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in a thalpi kuoi-in a thaltang tuh nading dawimunin ei nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thalbawm sunga thaltangte tawh ei kap a, ama in ka sin ka lungah tumsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate in sun tungtawnin ehnehna la ei awi awi vua, ka mipite’ nuizat ka hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in zatui kha ei dawnsah a, du lopi-in gamsai kha ei nesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in ka hate suongtang hlaisah a, vutvam ei buoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka hla in lungmuonna nei lo a, lungdamna kici bang ahei ka mangngil ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuaci’n keima in, “Ka vang bei zo a, Topa kung panin ka kinepna zosie tawp sieng zo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka gentheina le ka inn nei lonate ka lungngaina khu gamsai le tuikha ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in tuate ka sielsiel a, ka lungsim a genthei giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam thu ka phawh a, tua ziehin kinepna ka nei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa’ itna thawn ngai loin, ama’ hepinate tawp ngai lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuate zingmawng sielin ang thasuo zing hi; nangma’ thumanna lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hlagau in, “ Topa pen keima’ tanh ahi a, “Tua ahi ziehin ama sungah ka kinem ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a ngah mite ading le ama a sui hlagau adingin Topa hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ hutdamna khu daitaha nga khinkhian ding hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi khat in a khangno lai-in hahkol a puoh ding hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa in ama tungah hahkol a ngah ciengin ama guohin sip dide-a a to ding hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leivui lahah a kam koi leh hoi hi. (tua hile kinepna om kha thei lai ding hi),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a beng pa lamah a pheta daw-in, gensietna tawh a kidim ding hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa in ei nuol den lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in ei lungkhamsah nanle ama’ ei itna kip dung zui-in lainatna ei nei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile ama in koima gentheisah nuom loin, zong lungkhamsah nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gam sunga thongkie zosie keng tawh a kitotcil cieng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sangpen Pa’ masangah mihing’ hamphatna a kileheipieh cieng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />mi khat’ thu a manin a kikhen lo cieng, Topa in mu lo ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Topa in a gelkhol sih leh koi thupieh tawh pieng ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A sie a pha pen Sangpen Pa’ kam pana ang pusuoh hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A mawna dan uh a thuoh ciengun bang dingin phunphun ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I gamtatnate kisittelin Topa kungah kinuale va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Vantunga Pasien kungah i lungsimte ule i khutte uh lamto va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kote tawnkhielin kang ledo ta vua, nang in ka mawna uh nei maisah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang le nang lungthahna tawh kituomin nei nuadel a, khuotuona nei loin nei that hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />kote’ thungetna na kung ang tun thei lo nadingin nangma le nangma meiilum na kikhu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Nang in mite lahah kote buathah le ninthem bangin nei bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ka galte zosie a kam kah vua, kei langpanna thu a gengen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />kote tungah patauna le dumthuhpi ang tung a, a hawmkieu ding le a mangthai ding ka hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka mite a kisiet ziehin ka hlitui guntui luong bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Ka hlitui kang thei lo ding a, mit sing man loin ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa in van pan ang etsuh a, a mu masangsie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />ka khuopi ngahnu zosie ziehin ka mit in ei lungkhamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ka galte in thu om lopi-in va bangin keima ei vei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Leihawm sungah ka hingtangin ei paimang vua, suongtum tawh ei sincip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tui in ka lu ei hlum a, “A mangthai hi tang,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Topa aw, kuokhuh tawdop panin na min kang hlan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Panpi dinga ka tauna na bil na hu sinlen, ei lungnuomsah in,” ci-in kang ngetna nei za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Kang hlat ciengin keima nei neh a, “Zau sin,” nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Topa aw ka vai nei genpieh zo ta a, ka hinkhuo nei tankhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Aw Topa , ka tunga na hoi kibawlte na mu zo ta hi, ka vai ei hawmpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ka galte ei huotna le ei lebawlnate uh na mu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Topa aw, amau’ ei tawhnate le ei lebawlnate na za zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Sun tungtawnin kei ei langpangte in kei do nading kihodap-in ei gensiesie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />A to ule a din uh en vawi, ehnehna la ei sahlu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Topa aw, a gamtatna bang ule amau’ khuta a sepna utawh kituohin amate thuhkia in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Amate lungkhamna lungtang pie inlen, amate tungah na samsietna tusah in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na thangpaina ziehin Topa’ vante nei panin amate delmang inlen, thatgam sieng in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bang dingin kham muol dawh ta a, bang dingin kham citah a mel kilamdang ta adiei! Gawldung lamsuom tengah mun siengtho suongte kithezah sieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kham hoipen banga a manpha, Zion’ tapate khu bang dinga belkhengte khuta kikheng leibeelte tawh kibang dawh ta adiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Si-alte nangawn in zong a note nawi pie-in a tawpsah buong sam vua, hinanle zong ka mite pen a note tunga a gilo, gamlahah a om kalaoh vate tawh kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dangta ziehin a dangtawngah nausen’ lei a beh hi; naupangte in neh ding an a ngen vua, hinanle koima in bangma pie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An tuipen a ne ngaite zong lampi tengah a kielsi sieng vua, a nuomsa-a khangkhiete zong leivui lahah a lum ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Sodom danthuohna sangin ka mite kigawtna nasie zaw a, tua tungah khut kinga kha loin mitphet kala kisusie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milien milalte uh vua sangin sieng zaw a, bawngnawi sangin kangzaw uhi; suongsan mantam sangin amau’ pumpi sanzaw a, amau’ samte zong sapphire suongte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amau’ mai innking sangin vomzaw a, tu-in gawldung lahah amate a kithei kha sih hi. A gute uh tungah a vunte uh behcip a, singkung gawta tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lo sungah galete a pien lo ziehin neh ding nei loin gawngtamin a kielsi mite sangin, namsau-a a si mite hamphazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka mite kisuhsiet hun sungin mi lainat thei nupite’ khut in a tate’ sa huonin an-in a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in a lungthahna husuo zosie a hlakhie zo ta hi; ama in a lunghanna buosuhin Zion ah mei taw a, a khuombulte katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitung kumpite le leitung mi zosie in Jerusalem tunkotte ah gal le sa a lut zo dingin a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo lai-ah mi thumante’ sisan a luongsah kamsangte’ mawna le siempute’ khielna zieha tam thu ang pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mittaw bangin amate gawldung lahah a vahvai vua, a puonte uh koima’ tham ngam lo dingin sisan a bang netnut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pei dawh ta un! Mi sieng lote aw!” “Pei dawh ta un! Pei dawh ta un! Ei tham kha sih un!” ci-in mite a kiko uhi. Tuaci’n amate mi galtai le mi vahvaite a suoh ta uhi. Minamte lahah mite in, “Amate tanah om thei sih va uh,” ci san lel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in amate thezah zo a, amate a awlmaw nawn sih ding hi; siempute tungah zatahna a kilah ta sih a, makaite tungah zong deisahna a om ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Panpi ngenin i khuo dahdah vua, matlap om loin i mit uh a kham bep lel hi; ei hundam zo ngap lo ding minam khat tungah lawptahin eite in i ngahngah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I khuolai vuah i va thei lo nadingin amate in ei sulzui uhi; i si nading uh ang nai ta a, i nite uh ang cing ta hi; Bangzieh ahei cile i si hun uh ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eihaw ei delte ahi ule van lai-a leng mukel sangin a gangzaw uhi; amate in muol tungah ei del vua, gamlahah zong ei buhdap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Minamte lahah ama’ hlim belin i nungta ding uhi,” ci-in ka gen uh, ka nasuh ka natona uh ahi, Topa sathau nusa mipa, amate in a dum sung vuah ei matpieh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uz gama teng Edom’ tanu aw, lungdamin kipah in; ahi vangin nang tungah zong tua hai ang tung ding hi; tua hai khamin na puon hawh dawhin na guohtangin na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zion’ tanu aw, na mawna zieha dan ang kipiehna manzo ta a, ama in nang saltang dingin ang kaisah nawn sih ding hi; hinanle Edom’ tanu aw, ama in na mawna dan hing pie-in, na khielna zosie ang pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, kote tunga ang tung bang ahei ei phawh in; kote ei en inlen, ka zalatna uh ei mu in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Melmahte tungah ka gouluote uh kipie ta a, ka inn ka lote uzong pemtate tungah kipie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote pen tagate le pa nei lote ka hi ta uhi; ka nute uzong meigong ahi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka dawn ding uh tuisih zong lei kul hi; ka vah ding uh sing zong lei kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngawng vuah hahkol ei kivaw-in ei kinawmang gawp hi; kote ka balia ta vua, tawlngah hun ka nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote in hin theina khop anneh mu nadingin Egypt-te le Assyria-te tawh thukimna ka bawl zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate uh a maw uhi; amate a om nawn sih vua, tuaci’n amau’ khielna paat kote in ka puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Silate in kote tungah zingvai a hawm ta uhi; amau’ khut sung panin ei hunkhie ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gamlahah namsau ziehin luong khamin neh le tah ka sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gilkiel husapi ziehin lungthu bangin ka vunte uh a vomking hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion ah numeite le Judah khuopite ah ngahnute ei kibuonpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A khut utawh milien milalte a khailia vua, upate a kizatah nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tangvalte an kipausuhsah a, naupangte sing kipuosh a, a puo zo loin a hawilenpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tehsiete in khuopi tunkot a nuasie ta vua, khangnote in tumgingte a tum nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka lungsim vua kipahna teng a tawp sieng kiukeu ta hi; nunnuoma ka lamkaina uh dana suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lutung panun kumpi lukhu a kiesuh ta hi; kote ka tawnkhiel ziehun gimna thuoh ka hi ta uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam ziehin ka lungsim uh na a, tam thute ziehin ka mit uh a miel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zion Muol a daidam tah ziehin tua tungah si-alte vah kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang kumtawnin na maang a, a khangkhangin na kumpi topha a kip den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bang dinga kote nei ci pum mangngil ahei? Bang dinga kote ni tampi sung nei taisan ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa aw, kote kang kilekia thei nadingun nangma kungah ei peipi in; Masang lai-a bangin ka hinkhuo uh ei siemphat pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi sihle nang in kote ei pumnuol na ta amah? Kote tunga na lungthahna ciengtan nei lo a hi ta amah?
  </para>
</usx>
